Verse 1:
[Dm/A]When I [C]survey [F/C]thewondrous [C]cross [F/C]On which the [Gm/D]Prince [C7/Bb]ofglory [Dm/A]died,
[Dm/A]My richest [F/C]gain [Gm/D]Icount [F/C]butloss, And pour contempt [Dm/A]on [Gm/D]all [F/C]my [Gm/Bb]pride.

Verse 2:
